e**: Limits concurrent tasks using `asyncio.Semaphore(max_concurrent)`\n- **Concurrency control**: Each task acquires/releases the semaphore, so only N run at a time\n- **Graceful shutdown**: When you press Ctrl+C:\n  1. All tasks are cancelled (raising `CancelledError` in them)\n  2. `gather(..., return_exceptions=True)` waits for all tasks to finish their cleanup\n  3. The `KeyboardInterrupt` is re-raised to the caller\n\nThis ensures `try/finally` blocks in your tasks run even during interruption.","ttft_ms":11167,"type":"result","duration_ms":16520,"uuid":"8bc5ec4b-f3e9-4065-b2a0-b2e845aa6b76","ttft_stream_ms":921,"time_to_request_ms":80,"queued_turn_count":0}
